  <div class="stat-cards hero-features">
    <div class="card"><h3>AI writing tools</h3><p>Generate excerpts, summaries and better titles with Claude.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Analytics</h3><p>Daily views, top posts and per-post stats out of the box.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Newsletter</h3><p>Collect subscribers and export them anytime as CSV.</p></div>
